      "en": "My dwelling place[NOTE:1] is removed and taken away[NOTE:2] from meas a shepherd’s tent.I rolled up my life like a weaver rolls cloth;[NOTE:3] from the loom he cuts me off.[NOTE:4] You turn day into night and end my life.[NOTE:5]",
